label 5
text *Wham*
text @[Tomoya]
text Argh!
text Suddenly, something hits me in the back.
text And it was a very intense impact at that.
text For an instant I can't breathe, and my eyes flicker.
text My back feels like it is on fire. I turn around as I reach behind me to hold my back, and there stands...
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKY01A"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s5
fi
goto 6
label s5
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 6
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
music BGM03A.mp3
sound 8I0.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Ah, sorry!
text @[Tomoya]
text Y-You...! Don't tell me you hit me with that!
sound 8I1.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Ahahaha! Actually, I still am not very used to driving this!
sound 8I2.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I just got my license last week after all!
sound 8I3.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Of course I passed on my first try! So I bought myself a new bike! A new bike!♪
sound 8I4.aac
text @[Kyou]
text What do you think? Cool, isn't it?
text @[Tomoya]
text Apologize sincerely before you start boasting!
sound 8I5.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Eh? I did say "sorry" just now, didn't I?
text @[Tomoya]
text You call that being sincere? Show your sincerity in a more tangible way!
text @[Tomoya]
text Go look up the word "reparation" in the dictionary!
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKY01B"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s6
fi
goto 7
label s6
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 7
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
sound 8I6.aac
text @[Kyou]
text What are you talking about? It's your fault you're walking in the middle of the road!
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm a vulnerable pedestrian! You're going to get your license suspended for hurting someone!
sound 8I7.aac
text @[Kyou]
text You're such a whiner.
sound 8I8.aac
text @[Kyou]
text If you're so vulnerable, then walk along the edge of the street like a vulnerable pedestrian would.
sound 8I9.aac
text @[Kyou]
text You picked a fight with something stronger than you, and now that you lost you're playing the victim?
sound 8IA.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Don't be so petty.
text Hang on a minute. Why do I need to stand here and listen to her giving me crap?
text I wasn't trying to fight a bike.
text Hell, she rammed into me from behind. I am 100% the victim here.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Okay.
sound 8IB.aac
text @[Kyou]
text What is it?
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll call the cops and tell them there's been an accident here.
text @[Tomoya]
text No matter the reason, you are definitely getting your license revoked.
text @[Tomoya]
text Have fun spending all day listening to some boring lecture at traffic school.
sound 8IC.aac
text @[Kyou]
text If you even try to do that I'll turn you into roadkill.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text Her eyes aren't laughing.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm just kidding.
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKY01C"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s7
fi
goto 8
label s7
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 8
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
sound 8ID.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Well, I'm serious.
text I bet...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...By the way... what are you doing here this late?
text @[Tomoya]
text Besides, isn't it against school rules to come by motorbike?
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKY01A"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s8
fi
goto 9
label s8
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 9
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
sound 8IE.aac
text @[Kyou]
text It's because I'm late that I'm riding my bike!
sound 8IF.aac
text @[Kyou]
text There aren't that many people around, I'm in a rush, and it's a breeze!
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, you're still late. No matter how fast you go it doesn't matter in the end, right?
sound 8IG.aac
text @[Kyou]
text If you think like such a sloth you're going to waste your life away.
text @[Tomoya]
text Doesn't riding a bike to school because it's a breeze make you a sloth too?
sound 8IH.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Vehicles are the fruit of human intelligence! They're the pinnacle of civilization. They only have a purpose if you use them!
text What terrible reasoning...
text @[Tomoya]
text Then, at least give me a ride to school.
sound 8II.aac
text @[Kyou]
text This bike only seats one.
text @[Tomoya]
text If I squeeze in, there will be room for two.
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKY01C"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s9
fi
goto 10
label s9
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 10
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
sound 8IJ.aac
text @[Kyou]
text What? Could it be that... you want to hug me?
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you saying it's okay to?
sound 8IK.aac
text @[Kyou]
text If you're okay with not being able to eat anything but rice porridge for lunch.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound 8IL.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Oh, I meant I will break your jaw if you try.
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't need you to spell it out for me!
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKY01A"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
