text @[Kyou]
text Where the hell do you think you are sitting? If you break the wing, I'll break your nose!
text @[Tomoya]
text Didn't you say it's okay as long as I don't hug you?
sound 8IO.aac
text @[Kyou]
text In that case, sit on the seat and go throw your hands up in the air.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll get thrown off the bike!
sound 8IP.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I won't go that fast.
text @[Tomoya]
text Then give me more room on the seat.
sound 8IQ.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Sheesh... get off the bike for a second.
text @[Tomoya]
text Fine...
