text I slip off the rear wing, and stand next to the bike.
text @[Tomoya]
text All right, now make me some roo─
text *Vrroom*
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, where the hell are you going?!
sound 8IR.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Ahahahahaha! That's so naive of you, you dummy!
text Kyou's abusive words fade into the distance as she rides away from me.
text @[Tomoya]
text The next time I see your bike I'm sticking gum in its keyhole!
text With a screech, Kyou suddenly does a 180 in the distance.
text and charges this way!
