text After glaring at me, Kyou turns her bike around and rides away once more.
text She sure can't take a joke.
text I take a breath while glaring at the bike's tail light as it moves into the distance.
text ......
text That reminds me... Fujibayashi's fortune...
text I'll have an intense impact with a gentle girl...?
text Both my body and mind will be refreshed...?
text ...God damn... you imbecile...
